32 euros, was awarded in December 2025.\nWhat it cannot show: The concentration of contracts in December does not indicate improper activity. Similar patterns can occur due to seasonal demand or budget cycles. The number of awardees does not prove any single contract was improperly awarded.\nWhat can be checked: Check the dates and amounts of December contracts to see if they align with other contracts. Review awardee A's contracts to determine if they repeat the same service or need. Look for patterns in the December contracts to assess if they were part of a larger procurement strategy.","origen_es":"modelo","origen_en":"modelo","modelo":"Qwen3-4B (Q4_K_M, llama.cpp)","regla":"ss","citas":["ApRX1%2FlaQxP%2B3JAijKO%2Bkg%3D%3D","0I2hEOOzzMizz8fXU2i3eQ%3D%3D","UGnUu72EFzw7%2B9FIQYNjeQ%3D%3D"],"generado":"2026-11-15"}}